  "text": "## Complaint Handling Process  \n### Step 1: Initial Assessment (Day 1–2)  \n**Triage by Severity:**  \n**Urgent (Immediate Action):**\n- Financial loss >£1,000\n- Fraud/security breach\n- Service outage impact\n- Regulatory concern\n→ **Escalate to Manager immediately**  \n**Standard:**\n- Regular service issues\n- Fee disputes <£1,000\n- Operational delays\n→ **Process normally**",
  "name": "Chunk 10/36",
  "_domain": "banking.policy",
